---
// EcosystemDual.astro - Section 4: Dual-Column Ecosystem Grid (Matches Ref Section 3)
---

<section id="privacy" class="py-24 lg:py-32 bg-[#E3EBE9] relative overflow-hidden">
  <!-- Subtle Studio Accent Glow -->
  <div class="absolute left-1/4 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-96 h-96 bg-white/40 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12 relative z-10">
    
    <!-- Section Header (Subtle Centered Kicker) -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
        <span class="w-6 h-[1px] bg-[#52656B]/60"></span>
        <span class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-kicker uppercase text-[#52656B]">
          ARCHITECTURAL FOUNDATION
        </span>
        <span class="w-6 h-[1px] bg-[#52656B]/60"></span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-semibold text-[#1C2A30] tracking-tight">
        Privacy by architecture. <br />
        <span class="italic font-normal">Not by promise.</span>
      </h2>
    </div>

    <!-- Dual Column Grid (Ref Section 3 Composition) -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-10 items-stretch">
      
      <!-- Left Card: Soft Mint/Sage Ceramic Still-Life Box -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 bg-[#E8F0EE] border border-[#D0DCD9] rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-10 flex flex-col justify-between shadow-sm hover:shadow-pedestal transition-all duration-300 group">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-6">
            <span class="px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/80 text-xs font-mono font-medium text-[#1C2A30] border border-[#D0DCD9]">
              Local Isolation
            </span>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-[#52656B]">0 Cloud Telemetry</span>
          </div>

          <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-semibold text-[#1C2A30] tracking-tight mb-4">
            100% Client-Side Privacy.
          </h3>
          
          <p class="text-[#52656B] text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed mb-6 font-normal">
            Your code, confidential PDF documents, and high-resolution assets never touch an external server. Everything processes inside your browser's private memory through hardware-accelerated WebAssembly.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Ceramic Sculpture & Props Container (Ref Section 3 Graphic) -->
        <div class="relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-[#D0DCD9]/80 shadow-sm mt-4 bg-white/50">
          <img 
            src="/assets/ceramic-props.jpg" 
            alt="Ceramic props representing tactile local privacy"
            loading="lazy"
            class="w-full h-64 sm:h-72 object-cover object-center transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105"
          />
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#1C2A30]/50 via-transparent to-transparent flex items-end p-5">
            <div class="text-white text-xs font-mono flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400"></span>
              <span>Sub-millisecond local execution &bull; Zero data transmission</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Card: White Card with PDF Toolkit & Image Compressor -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 bg-white border border-[#D0DCD9] rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-10 flex flex-col justify-between shadow-sm hover:shadow-pedestal transition-all duration-300">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-6">
            <span class="px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#F4F7F6] text-xs font-mono font-medium text-[#1C2A30] border border-[#D0DCD9]">
              WASM Engine
            </span>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-emerald-700 font-semibold bg-emerald-50 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full border border-emerald-200">
              17-in-1 Suite Live
            </span>
          </div>

          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-kicker uppercase text-[#52656B]">
              FLAGSHIP CLIENT UTILITIES
            </span>
          </div>

          <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-semibold text-[#1C2A30] tracking-tight mb-4">
            LS PDF Toolkit &amp; <br />
            <span class="italic font-normal">Next-Gen Image Compressor.</span>
          </h3>

          <p class="text-[#52656B] text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed mb-6 font-normal">
            A comprehensive suite of 17 client-side PDF utilities paired with an intelligent image compressor supporting 9+ formats with up to 90% size reduction &mdash; completely free, no subscriptions, and zero file uploads.
          </p>

          <!-- Key Metrics / Feature Badges -->
          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 mb-8">
            <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-[#F4F7F6] border border-[#D0DCD9]/70">
              <div class="font-serif text-2xl font-semibold text-[#1C2A30]">17 Tools</div>
              <div class="text-xs text-[#52656B] mt-0.5">Merge, Split, Encrypt, OCR</div>
            </div>
            <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-[#F4F7F6] border border-[#D0DCD9]/70">
              <div class="font-serif text-2xl font-semibold text-[#1C2A30]">90% Less</div>
              <div class="text-xs text-[#52656B] mt-0.5">Zero quality loss compression</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Pill CTA & Secondary Trigger -->
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 pt-4 border-t border-[#D0DCD9]/50">
          <a 
            href="https://ladestack.in" 
            target="_blank" 
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="group inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 px-6 py-3 text-xs font-semibold tracking-wide text-white bg-[#1C2A30] hover:bg-[#2C3E46] rounded-full shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300"
          >
            <span>Launch Privacy Tools</span>
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3"></path>
            </svg>
          </a>

          <a 
            href="#products" 
            class="text-xs font-medium text-[#52656B] hover:text-[#1C2A30] transition-colors"
          >
            View All 5 Tools &darr;
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
